# Error Handling

- Wrap async operations in try-catch
- Return safe defaults on error (null, empty list, etc.)
- Platform check before platform-specific code: `kIsWeb`, `Platform.isX`
- In Cubit: `stateChanger(state.copyWith(status: error, errorMessage: e.toString()))`
